<title>USA: Eastern Energy Ltd sells $350 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Eastern Energy Ltd sells $350 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-part debt 144a debt issue from Eastern Energy was priced on Thursday, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER: EASTERN ENERGY LTD</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 12/1/06</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.628  FIRST PAY DATE 6/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 6.802 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 69 BPS     CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT     MATURITY 12/1/16</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.458    FIRST PAY DATE 6/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.302 PCT     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 85 BPS	 CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
